# Mythos skills allowlist.
#
# One skill name per line. '#' lines are comments. Edit freely — no code
# changes needed to add or remove an entry.
#
# A leading '?' marks the entry OPTIONAL: MYTHOS uses it when the host CLI has
# it installed, but it is deliberately NOT vendored into this repo (too large,
# or it needs a database this repo does not ship). An optional entry that does
# not resolve is the normal state of a fresh clone and is never warned about.
# A plain entry that does not resolve IS reported — treat that as a bug.
#
# Resolution order is repo-vendored (mythos/skills/<name>/) first, then
# $MYTHOS_SKILLS_DIR, ~/.claude/skills, the plugin packs, ~/.zcode/skills.
#
# These are surfaced to the model in every prompt as one-liners; the model
# calls use_skill(<name>) to load full guidance on demand.

# ---- Design / UI ----
taste-frontend
# ui-ux-pro-max is essence-only in this repo (SKILL-CORE.md drives build-lane
# injection). Its full 45 KB SKILL.md plus CSV database stay a host install.
?ui-ux-pro-max
?frontend-patterns
?frontend-ui-engineering
?design-system

